        "TileImage": "$($repository 427e3109-2bd2-4453-91dc-8eef1203ea42).Image",
        "Description": "For years, Russian financier Ivan Berezovski operated in the shadows of Southeast Asia, laundering billions through luxury hotels, casinos, and shipping companies hidden behind legitimate tourism businesses. Untouchable by international authorities, Berezovski built an empire fueled by corruption and fear.\r\rBut every empire has its weak point.\r\rThat weakness was Mrs. Mookjai — a respected Thai businesswoman publicly known for charity work and cultural investments, who helped him.\r\rGood Luck, 47.",
